Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.20,Credit,,0,0,0,,Whip  @whipcampaigns\NEnergy Secretary Chris Wright\NSource: Fox News, America Reports, Nov. 19, 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, with the trends we have\Nright now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect gasoline and diesel\Nto continue downward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're continuing to grow the supply\Nof these energy projects,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,of these energy products, in spite of all\Nthe challenges around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,China holding back on exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Russia's exports almost\Ncompletely shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gulf exports were down\Nby two-thirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they've been bouncing back for,\Nas they said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,sort of four, six, seven, eight weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So things are going\Nin the right direction, Sandra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I would expect continued\Ndownward pressure on prices.
